# SIEM Detection Lab — Active Environment Access Details (Template)

*Template reference for local operator setup. Fill in with your provisioned values.*

---

## 1. Virtual Machine Access (3-Tier Hardened Architecture)

### Tier 3: Admin Bastion Jumpbox (`siem-lab-bastion`)
- **Subnet**: `siem-lab-admin-subnet` (`10.0.30.0/24`)
- **Public IP**: `<BASTION_PUBLIC_IP>` (retrieve via: `terraform output -raw bastion_public_ip`)
- **Private IP**: `10.0.30.2`
- **Machine Type**: `e2-micro` (2 vCPU, 1 GB RAM, 20 GB standard PD)
- **Allowed Management IP**: `<YOUR_PUBLIC_IP>/32` (strictly restricted by GCP firewall)
- **Identity & Access**: GCP OS Login enabled (`enable-oslogin = "TRUE"`), MFA-capable
- **SSH Command**:
  ```bash
  ssh -i ~/.ssh/siem_lab_key ubuntu@<BASTION_PUBLIC_IP>
  ```

---

### Tier 2: SIEM Core Manager VM (`siem-lab-wazuh`)
- **Subnet**: `siem-lab-siem-subnet` (`10.0.20.0/24`)
- **Public IP**: **None** (resides strictly in isolated private core subnet)
- **Private IP**: `10.0.20.2`
- **Machine Type**: `e2-standard-2` (2 vCPU, 8 GB RAM, 100 GB SSD)
- **Internet Access**: Google Cloud NAT Gateway (outbound updates only, no public inbound)
- **Secure SSH via Bastion Jumpbox**:
  ```bash
  ssh -i ~/.ssh/siem_lab_key -J ubuntu@<BASTION_PUBLIC_IP> ubuntu@10.0.20.2
  ```
- **Wazuh Web Dashboard (Encrypted Local Tunnel)**:
  - Command to open tunnel:
    ```bash
    ssh -i ~/.ssh/siem_lab_key -N -L 8443:10.0.20.2:443 ubuntu@<BASTION_PUBLIC_IP>
    ```
  - Local URL: `https://localhost:8443`
  - **Username**: `admin`
  - **Password**: `<PRINTED_AT_INSTALLATION_OR_IN_WAZUH_PASSWORDS_TXT>`

---

### Tier 1: Honeypot VM (`siem-lab-honeypot`)
- **Subnet**: `siem-lab-dmz-subnet` (`10.0.10.0/24`)
- **Public IP**: `<HONEYPOT_PUBLIC_IP>` (retrieve via: `terraform output -raw honeypot_public_ip`)
- **Private IP**: `10.0.10.2`
- **Machine Type**: `e2-micro` (2 vCPU burstable, 1 GB RAM, 30 GB standard PD)
- **SSH Ingress Exposure**: `0.0.0.0/0` (Intentional Honeypot)
- **Direct SSH Command**:
  ```bash
  ssh -i ~/.ssh/siem_lab_key ubuntu@<HONEYPOT_PUBLIC_IP>
  ```

---

## 2. Active Security & Firewall Posture Summary

```
╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║              SIEM Lab — Active Security Posture Summary              ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ TIER 1: HONEYPOT VM (<HONEYPOT_PUBLIC_IP>) — DMZ Subnet 10.0.10.0/24  ║
║   • INGRESS: TCP 22 → 0.0.0.0/0 (Honeypot target)                    ║
║   • EGRESS:  TCP 1514, 1515 → 10.0.20.0/24 (Wazuh telemetry to SIEM) ║
║   • EGRESS:  Canonical Ubuntu CIDRs (80, 443) & DNS (8.8.8.8, 1.1.1.1)║
║   • EGRESS:  DENY 169.254.169.254/32 (Metadata blocked at Priority 900)║
║   • EGRESS:  DENY ALL other outbound traffic (Priority 65534)        ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ TIER 2: SIEM CORE VM (10.0.20.2) — Core Subnet 10.0.20.0/24          ║
║   • PUBLIC IP: NONE (Zero internet ingress attack surface)           ║
║   • INGRESS: TCP 22, 443 → 10.0.30.0/24 (Admin Subnet via Bastion)   ║
║   • INGRESS: TCP 1514, 1515 → 10.0.10.2 (Honeypot Agent only)        ║
║   • INGRESS: DENY TCP 9200, 9300 from 0.0.0.0/0 (OpenSearch protected)║
║   • EGRESS:  Cloud NAT (outbound updates only)                       ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ TIER 3: ADMIN BASTION (<BASTION_PUBLIC_IP>) — Admin Subnet 10.0.30.0 ║
║   • INGRESS: TCP 22 → <YOUR_PUBLIC_IP>/32 (Analyst IP only)          ║
║   • ACCESS:  GCP OS Login enabled, MFA-capable, centralized IAM      ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
```

