## 3. Operational Quick Reference

```bash
# Connect to Honeypot
ssh -i ~/.ssh/siem_lab_key ubuntu@<HONEYPOT_PUBLIC_IP>

# Connect to Bastion
ssh -i ~/.ssh/siem_lab_key ubuntu@<BASTION_PUBLIC_IP>

# Connect to SIEM through Bastion ProxyJump
ssh -i ~/.ssh/siem_lab_key -J ubuntu@<BASTION_PUBLIC_IP> ubuntu@10.0.20.2

# Open Wazuh Dashboard Local Tunnel (run in background or terminal window)
ssh -i ~/.ssh/siem_lab_key -N -L 8443:10.0.20.2:443 ubuntu@<BASTION_PUBLIC_IP>
# Then open: https://localhost:8443

# Tail alerts live on SIEM
ssh -i ~/.ssh/siem_lab_key -J ubuntu@<BASTION_PUBLIC_IP> ubuntu@10.0.20.2 \
  "sudo tail -f /var/ossec/logs/alerts/alerts.json"

# Import Dashboards via Local Tunnel
bash wazuh/dashboards/import_dashboards.sh localhost:8443 <WAZUH_PASSWORD>
```
